  "keyFeatures": [
    "Edge AI visual classification of PCBs and batteries using YOLOv8 on Raspberry Pi 5",
    "Real-time material composition and value tier assignment (HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW)",
    "Batch lifecycle tracking from intake through to completed procurement",
    "Digital Showroom B2B marketplace for refineries to browse and book verified e-waste batches",
    "Multi-tenant platform supporting Recycling Centers and Refinery companies",
    "Progressive Web App for on-site sorting and a Flutter mobile app for the Digital Showroom",
    "JWT-based authentication with role-based access control (Admin, Worker, Refinery Operator)",
    "WebSocket-based real-time telemetry streaming from edge hardware to cloud"
  ],
